Canonical website:
  https://github.com/google/sentencepiece

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/archive/refs/tags/v0.2.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sentencepiece-0.2.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sentencepiece-0.2.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sentencepiece-0.2.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sentencepiece-0.2.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsentencepiece0-0.2.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsentencepiece-devel-0.2.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

